### Authentication: Request Microsoft authorize URL
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/auth/login/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "redirect": "https://frontend.example.com/auth/callback"
}

### Authentication: Callback (exchange code for tokens)
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/auth/callback/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "<authorization_code>",
  "redirect": "https://frontend.example.com/auth/callback"
}

### Authentication: Refresh access token
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/auth/refresh/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "<refresh_token_here>"
}

### Authentication: Logout (revoke refresh token)
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/auth/logout/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "<refresh_token_here>"
}

### Users: Get current user
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/users/me/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Users: Patch current user
PATCH https://api.example.com/api/v1/users/me/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email_verified": true
}

### Users: Delete current user
DELETE https://api.example.com/api/v1/users/me/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Chats: List chats (with pagination / filtering)
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/chats/?page=1&page_size=20&type=assistant&search=test HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Chats: Create chat
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/chats/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New chat from frontend",
  "type": "assistant"
}

### Chats: Retrieve chat
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/chats/<chat_id>/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Chats: Update chat (owner only)
PATCH https://api.example.com/api/v1/chats/<chat_id>/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title"
}

### Chats: Soft-delete chat (owner only)
DELETE https://api.example.com/api/v1/chats/<chat_id>/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Messages: List chat messages (paginated)
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/chats/<chat_id>/messages/?page=1&page_size=50 HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Messages: Create message in chat
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/chats/<chat_id>/messages/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user",
  "content": "Hello, how can I apply?",
  "token_count": 6
}

### Messages: Retrieve single message
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/messages/<message_id>/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Files: Upload file (multipart/form-data)
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/files/upload/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

<PASTE FILE CONTENT HERE>
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

My Document Title
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Files: List documents
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/files/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Files: Retrieve document metadata
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/files/<file_id>/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Files: Delete document
DELETE https://api.example.com/api/v1/files/<file_id>/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Files: Start processing document (split -> embed)
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/files/<file_id>/process/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### Files: List document chunks
GET https://api.example.com/api/v1/files/<file_id>/chunks/?page=1&page_size=50 HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>


### RAG: Semantic search (top-K)
POST https://api.example.com/api/v1/rag/search/ HTTP/1.1
Host: api.example.com
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How to apply for admission?",
  "top_k": 5
}
